# fixture: added_class_with_parent_before.ttl
# Purpose: baseline with a single stable class ex:Base. Pairs with the _after
# file, which introduces ex:Child as a brand-new class that is asserted to be a
# subclass of ex:Base. Exercises the Component 06 / 07 hand-off: the new class's
# subClassOf edge belongs to its introduction, not to a standalone parent-added.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:Base a owl:Class .
